## Unresponsive script dialog

dom-slow-script-dialog-title = Temošo: Sekripte sa go se arabele
dom-slow-script-dialog-message = Sekripte sa mo letlakaleng le se ka no ba se swaregile, goba se ka no ba se emišitše go arabela. O ka emiša sekripte gona bjale, goba o ka tšwelapele go bona ge e ba sekripte se tla fetša.
# Variables:
#   $location (String) - URL of the script, followed by a colon and the line number (e.g. “https://example.com/script.js:42”). Long URLs are shortened with an ellipsis in the middle.
dom-slow-script-dialog-location = Sekripte: { $location }
